=2 Walkthrough
* After speaking with {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}, proceed to the Fortilace at L-9 in {z:Sauromugue Champaign (S)}.
* Enter the BCNM and defeat 6 {m:Yagudo Stormers|Yagudo Stormer}.
** The battle is capped at 30 minutes.
** Buffs will remain if cast prior to entering the battlefield.
* There are two Garrisons in this battle. One is ahead of where you start, the other is further west.
* 6 Yagudo Stormers will spawn from the north. 3 will apporach each Garrison and attack it.
* After defeating the 6 Yagudo, exit the BCNM via the Dawn Aureole.
* Only the party leader needs the Ops orders for the whole party to enter the BCNM. Everyone will receive {p:Experience Points} upon completion of the BCNM.
